<template><div><h1 id="wiki_main_quest">Main Quest</h1><section><h2 id="details-setup">Power, projector and Shurikens</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-setup-power" data-guide-step>Enable power at Spawn subway’s pillar, Disco roof beside Quickies, Park wall left of Deadeye Dewdrops and Main Street subway across from Bang Bangs. Collect a flyer (Dojo trash, Racin’ Stripes chair, Disco roof stool or Pink Cat sidewalk), the coin under sewer Tuff ’Nuff and a film reel (Disco couch, Pink Cat couch, subway boxes, sewer stairs or Rat King’s wall holes).<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1170.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1170.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Main Street subway power&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Main Street subway power&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/shaolin_shuffle/shaolin_shuffle_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1170&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1171.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1171.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Dojo flyer&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Dojo flyer&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/shaolin_shuffle/shaolin_shuffle_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1171&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1172.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1172.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Rooftop flyer&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Rooftop flyer&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&