me studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/shaolin_shuffle/shaolin_shuffle_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1176&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1178.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1178.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Subway film reel&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Subway film reel&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/shaolin_shuffle/shaolin_shuffle_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1178&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-setup-projector" data-guide-step>Use the flyer on the Pink Cat front door, the coin on its left private-room door and the reel on the projector. The wall portal reaches Pack-a-Punch during each visit window. On/after Scene 5, speak to Pam in the Dojo, drink a Chi gourd and make fifteen melee kills in that style to unlock Shurikens.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1181.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1181.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Pink Cat entrance&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Pink Cat entrance&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/shaolin_shuffle/shaolin_shuffle_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1181&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1182.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1182.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Private room&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Private room&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/shaolin_shuffle/shaolin_shuffle_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1182&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1183.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1183.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Projector&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Projector&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/shaolin_shuffle/shaolin_shuffle_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1183&quot;}]' /></li></ol></section>
<section><h2 id="details-rats">Follow the rat and earn the key</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-rats-release" data-guide-step>Let Pam finish the dialogue that starts the rat hunt. Throw a Shuriken at a cage, then follow the rat and release it from each successive cage. Starting cages include the Dojo ramp and Heebie Geebies hallway. The sixth cage disappears and leaves a yellow circle.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1239.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1239.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Rat cage: Dojo ramp&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Rat cage: Dojo ramp&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/shaolin_shuffle/shaolin_shuffle_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1239&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1240.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1240.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Rat cage: Heebie Geebies&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Rat cage: Heebie Geebies&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/shaolin_shuffle/shaolin_shuffle_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1240&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-rats-key" data-guide-step>Kill zombies while they are inside the circle until it vanishes, then defeat the ninjas. Take the gold key at its former center. A player need not count ordinary kills outside the circle as progress.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1241.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1241.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Rat defence circle&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Rat defence circle&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/shaolin_shuffle/shaolin_shuffle_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1241&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1242.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1242.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Gold key&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Gold key&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/shaolin_shuffle/shaolin_shuffle_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1242&quot;}]' /></li></ol></section>
<section><h2 id="details-soulkey">Open the locker and shoot the four fixed symbols</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-soulkey-locker" data-guide-step>Use the gold key on the symbol-covered locker in the Bang Bangs subway. Shoot the required four symbols in order: left symbol beside the Dojo; second-from-left symbol in the downstairs Disco bathroom; first-from-left beside the Park Volk; then second-from-left at that same Park wall. Wrong order restarts at the first shot.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1243.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1243.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Symbol locker&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Symbol locker&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/shaolin_shuffle/shaolin_shuffle_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1243&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1244.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1244.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Dojo: first required symbol&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Dojo: first required symbol&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/shaolin_shuffle/shaolin_shuffle_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1244&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1245.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1245.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Bathroom: second required symbol&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Bathroom: second required symbol&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/shaolin_shuffle/shaolin_shuffle_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1245&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1246.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1246.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Park: third and fourth symbols&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Park: third and fourth symbols&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/shaolin_shuffle/shaolin_shuffle_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1246&quot;}]' /></li></ol></section>
<section><h2 id="details-eye">Collect the eye and find six orange symbols</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-eye-rat-king" data-guide-step>Activate the street symbol in front of the Dojo, defeat the Rat King and take his eye. Speak to Pam again and let her finish the next quest dialogue.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1247.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1247.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Dojo Rat King marker&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Dojo Rat King marker&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/shaolin_shuffle/shaolin_shuffle_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1247&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1248.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1248.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Rat King eye&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Rat King eye&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/shaolin_shuffle/shaolin_shuffle_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1248&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-eye-hunt" data-guide-step>Scan with the tactical-slot eye and shoot the active orange symbol. Only one exists at a time; after each shot let the eye recharge and search again. Candidates: Spawn train top; barbershop window; Dojo main door; Heebie stage speaker; Bombstoppers police-car door; first uphill spawn window; building by RPR; clothesline near Park wheel; blue Trail Blazers room floor; Disco water tower; skylight air duct; Disco street sign; and behind the Bang Bangs stairs.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1250.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1250.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Above Spawn train&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Above Spawn train&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/shaolin_shuffle/shaolin_shuffle_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1250&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1251.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1251.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Barbershop window&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Barbershop window&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/shaolin_shuffle/shaolin_shuffle_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1251&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1252.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1252.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Dojo door&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Dojo door&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/