mrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/shaolin_shuffle/shaolin_shuffle_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1260&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1261.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1261.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Disco street sign&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Disco street sign&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/shaolin_shuffle/shaolin_shuffle_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1261&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1262.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1262.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Subway stair rear&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Subway stair rear&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/shaolin_shuffle/shaolin_shuffle_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1262&quot;}]' /></li></ol></section>
<section><h2 id="details-phone">Decode the phone and choose the poster</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-phone-listen" data-guide-step>After six symbols, use the ringing non-red phone in either subway. Record its three five-pulse digit groups and let the call finish. Being hit or hanging up early requires another listen. The helper keeps invalid/missed groups in place and preserves leading zeroes.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1263.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1263.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Phone digit-Morse reference&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Phone digit-Morse reference&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:960,&quot;height&quot;:540,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/shaolin_shuffle/shaolin_shuffle_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1263&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-phone-poster" data-guide-step>Collect the Nightmare Summer poster whose lower-left Film Registration matches the decoded number. Candidates: Spawn’s Up ’N Atoms train side, Dojo left, Dojo ramp/wheel, Bombstoppers alley, Disco skylight roof and Main Street subway stair base. A wrong poster restarts the six-symbol hunt and phone observation.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1264.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1264.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Poster registration close-up&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Poster registration close-up&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:654,&quot;height&quot;:918,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/shaolin_shuffle/shaolin_shuffle_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1264&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1265.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1265.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Spawn poster&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Spawn poster&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/shaolin_shuffle/shaolin_shuffle_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1265&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1266.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1266.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Dojo poster&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Dojo poster&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/shaolin_shuffle/shaolin_shuffle_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1266&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1267.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1267.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Ramp poster&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Ramp poster&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/shaolin_shuffle/shaolin_shuffle_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1267&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1268.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1268.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Alley poster&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Alley poster&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/shaolin_shuffle/shaolin_shuffle_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1268&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1269.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1269.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Roof poster&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Roof poster&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/shaolin_shuffle/shaolin_shuffle_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1269&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1270.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1270.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Main Street subway poster&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Main Street subway poster&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/shaolin_shuffle/shaolin_shuffle_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1270&quot;}]' /></li></ol><InlineTool tool="iw-shaolin-morse" /></section>
<section><h2 id="details-word">Complete the rooftop word</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-word-spotlight" data-guide-step>Place the poster on the Disco roof spotlight. Explode the projected X window and defeat the spawned ninjas. An initial letter and six shootable Wyler glyphs now appear.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1271.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1271.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Roof spotlight&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Roof spotlight&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/shaolin_shuffle/shaolin_shuffle_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1271&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1272.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1272.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Projected X window&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Projected X window&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/shaolin_shuffle/shaolin_shuffle_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1272&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1273.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1273.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Initial word letter&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Initial word letter&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/shaolin_shuffle/shaolin_shuffle_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1273&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-word-letters" data-guide-step>Read glyphs with the alphabet reference and record confirmed positional letters. Shoot a candidate next letter only after comparing possible words. Rooftop glyphs are beside the word, behind Quickies’ corner, under wheel scaffolding, beside the clock spawn, back-left wall and the KBS white table. Wrong letters reset the current word; repeated failures can require the next round. A new attempt must clear obsolete mask/rejections while preserving the completed phone stage.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1274.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1274.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Glyph by the word&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Glyph by the word&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/shaolin_shuffle/shaolin_shuffle_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1274&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1275.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1275.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Quickies corner&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Quickies corner&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/shaolin_shuffle/shaolin_shuffle_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1275&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1276.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1276.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Wheel scaffolding&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Wheel scaffolding&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/shaolin_shuffle/shaolin_shuffle_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1276&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1277.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1277.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Clock spawn&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Clock spawn&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/shaolin_shuffle/shaolin_shuffle_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1277&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1278.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1278.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Back-left wall&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Back-left wall&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/shaolin_shuffle/shaolin_shuffle_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1278&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1279.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1279.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;White table&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;White table&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/shaolin_shuffle/shaolin_shuffle_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1279&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-word-complete" data-guide-step>The completed word gives a gong and removes the glyphs. Use the next Rat King marker at Park’s RPR Evo wallbuy.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1280.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1280.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Brain fight marker&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Brain fight marker&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/shaolin_shuffle/shaolin_shuffle_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1280&quot;}]' /></li></ol><InlineTool tool="iw-shaolin-word" /></section>
<section><h2 id="details-brain">Take the brain and start the heart route</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-brain-brain" data-guide-step>Defeat the RPR-marked Rat King and take his brain. Return to Pam. Following her next dialogue, watch the cigarette-burn marks over the next three round starts.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1281.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1281.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Rat King brain&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Rat King brain&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/shaolin_shuffle/shaolin_shuffle_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1281&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1282.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1282.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Round-transition cigarette burn&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Round-transition cigarette burn&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/shaolin_shuffle/shaolin_shuffle_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1282&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-brain-lockdown" data-guide-step>The following sequence skips rounds and blocks the Dojo street with fire. Defeat its enemies and take the turnstile piece. The fire clears when the event finishes.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1283.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1283.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Turnstile piece&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Turnstile piece&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/shaolin_shuffle/shaolin_shuffle_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1283&quot;}]' /></li></ol></section>
<section><h2 id="details-turnstile">Repair the subway and complete the circles</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-turnstile-gate" data-guide-step>Fit the piece to Spawn’s broken turnstile. Climb the Mule Munchies alley ladder and shoot the window glyph; the window closes and creates the first glowing circle.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1284.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1284.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Broken Spawn turnstile&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Broken Spawn turnstile&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/shaolin_shuffle/shaolin_shuffle_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1284&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1285.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1285.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Alley ladder&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Alley ladder&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/shaolin_shuffle/shaolin_shuffle_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1285&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1286.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1286.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Window glyph&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Window glyph&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/shaolin_shuffle/shaolin_shuffle_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1286&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-turnstile-circles" data-guide-step>Kill zombies inside each active circle, then find the next. Candidates: Mule/Bombstoppers alley, private Disco room, Park path, RPR Evo and Spawn’s Hornet area. Continue until the completion gong.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1287.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1287.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Mule alley circle&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Mule alley circle&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/shaolin_shuffle/shaolin_shuffle_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1287&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1288.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1288.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Disco private-room circle&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Disco private-room circle&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/shaolin_shuffle/shaolin_shuffle_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1288&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1289.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1289.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Park-path circle&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Park-path circle&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/shaolin_shuffle/shaolin_shuffle_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1289&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1290.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1290.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;RPR circle&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;RPR circle&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/shaolin_shuffle/shaolin_shuffle_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1290&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1291.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1291.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Hornet circle&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Hornet circle&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/shaolin_shuffle/shaolin_shuffle_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1291&quot;}]' /></li></ol></section>
<section><h2 id="details-disco">Transfer the disco ball ten times</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-disco-dj" data-guide-step>Interact with the upstairs Disco DJ booth. Keep another zombie on the active dance floor before killing the passive zombie carrying the disco ball; it transfers to that waiting target. Repeat ten transfers without ending the round.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1292.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1292.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Disco DJ booth&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Disco DJ booth&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/shaolin_shuffle/shaolin_shuffle_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1292&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1293.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1293.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Disco-ball zombie&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Disco-ball zombie&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/shaolin_shuffle/shaolin_shuffle_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1293&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-disco-retry" data-guide-step>Killing the carrier without another zombie on the floor resets the chain. If it becomes the last zombie of the round, ending the round also resets it. Wait for the replacement carrier and restart a complete chain.</li></ol></section>
<section><h2 id="details-heart">Third Rat King and final preparation</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-heart-heart" data-guide-step>After the transfer gong, use the Rat King glyph in front of Pink Cat. Defeat him and take the heart. Speak to Pam before entering the sewer lair.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1294.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1294.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Heart fight marker&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Heart fight marker&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/shaolin_shuffle/shaolin_shuffle_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1294&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1295.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1295.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Rat King heart&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Rat King heart&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/shaolin_shuffle/shaolin_shuffle_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1295&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-heart-prepare" data-guide-step>Resupply a high-capacity bullet weapon, upgrades and perks before entering. The eye challenge requires many shots before its reward ammo; entering with insufficient ammunition can stop progression. Cards and weapons that help are optional equipment choices.</li></ol></section>
<section><h2 id="details-finale">Complete the three organ challenges</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-finale-damage" data-guide-step>Damage the Rat King until he retreats. Avoid firing continuously into his raised shield; Shurikens can destroy the staff temporarily. Select an organ and then the central floor symbol to start its challenge. Any challenge order is allowed.</li>
<li id="guide-step-finale-eye-challenge" data-guide-step>Eye: use scans to reveal pink ceiling/wall glyphs and shoot every revealed mark. Delays allow his shield to add more glyphs. Brain: protect the friendly blue-eyed attackers while they destroy the central brain; do not shoot those allies. Heart: kill a zombie in each acid puddle and clear the entire perimeter before new acid appears.</li>
<li id="guide-step-finale-finish" data-guide-step>Each completed challenge gives a gong and a persistent central Max Ammo. Pick it up when needed, damage the boss into another retreat and start the next organ. After all three, kill the Rat King and collect the central Soul Key after the ending; Director’s Cut also supplies the talisman.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1296.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1296.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Soul Key&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Soul Key&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/shaolin_shuffle/shaolin_shuffle_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1296&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1297.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1297.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Director’s Cut talisman&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Director’s Cut talisman&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/shaolin_shuffle/shaolin_shuffle_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1297&quot;}]' /></li></ol></section>
<h1 id="wiki_side_quests">Side Quests</h1><section><h2 id="details-chi-and-travel">Chi styles, travel and double Pack-a-Punch</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-chi-and-travel-styles" data-guide-step>Dragon, Tiger, Crane and Snake have independent upgrade progress. Start with melee kills, then complete the displayed style challenges to unlock Shuriken, special and ultimate tiers. Gourds recharge the ability and eventually respawn; changing style preserves its previous progress. Chi melee/Shurikens break the Torii barriers.</li>
<li id="guide-step-chi-and-travel-travel" data-guide-step>Break both doors of each travel pair: Racin’ Stripes roof ↔ street right of Blue Bolts; Heebie alley ↔ Main Street subway lower floor. Open the rooftop Torii gates as well. For double Pack-a-Punch, press the projector-room button, exit and take Blue Bolts’ street portal; collect the briefly exposed fuses beside the roof arrival. A miss can be retried after the projector cooldown.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1184.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1184.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Projector-room button&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Projector-room button&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/shaolin_shuffle/shaolin_shuffle_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1184&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1185.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1185.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Timed fuse box&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Timed fuse box&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/shaolin_shuffle/shaolin_shuffle_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1185&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-chi-and-travel-charge" data-guide-step>Put the fuses on the Main Street subway electric rails, let the train run over them, recover and install them in the projector. The upgrade lasts this match.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1186.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1186.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Fuse charging rails&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Fuse charging rails&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/shaolin_shuffle/shaolin_shuffle_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1186&quot;}]' /></li></ol></section>
<section><h2 id="details-katana-and-nunchakus">Katana and Nunchakus unlocks</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-katana-and-nunchakus-katana" data-guide-step>Completing Pest Control at least once makes the Dojo Katana available in future matches for 10,000 points; it is free in the match where you finish the quest. It can be Pack-a-Punched.</li>
<li id="guide-step-katana-and-nunchakus-clock-items" data-guide-step>For Nunchakus, open both travel pairs and all Torii gates. Take your character’s item at Blue Bolts. Trigger the Disco clock, melee that item, take the portal and melee its second wooden-stack counterpart. Next use the subway clock: portal to the Bombstoppers dumpster script, return and melee the Bang Bangs floor script. Then roof clock: drop through skylight to the Rack-9 book, return and melee the roof ledge book. A failed clock-item stage waits for the next round.</li>
<li id="guide-step-katana-and-nunchakus-tv" data-guide-step>Set your character’s TV to its cartoon: Sally Spawn train, Andre Heebie, Poindexter RPR roof, AJ Blue Bolts. Defeat the ninja/zombie wave until colour bars appear. Quickly punch roof clock, Disco clock, then subway clock; the rewarded Fire Sale’s first Wheel draw grants Nunchakus. Timeout in this final clock chain can be retried immediately.</li></ol></section>
<section><h2 id="details-mahjong-equipment">Mahjong craftable equipment</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-mahjong-equipment-tables" data-guide-step>Find the three missing matching tiles for a named equipment table, carrying one tile at a time. All returned tiles create its pickup, which respawns two rounds after collection. Toy Robot table: Dojo bus (bus roof, Spawn/Dojo stairs, Tuff ’Nuff crate). Boombox table: Racin’ Stripes stair base (Dojo ramp bricks/spool, top stairs, roof chute bucket).</li>
<li id="guide-step-mahjong-equipment-other-tables" data-guide-step>Zom-B-Gone: Bombstoppers table and nearby fence/private Disco/portal/pallet/Heebie sites. Lava Lamp: Park wheel table and R-VN table/stairs, Volk garbage and nearby house. Sentry: Disco subway entrance table and entrance, Pink Cat van, wheel pallet, coat-check counter, upstairs pillar or Tuff ’Nuff stairs. These collections are separate from the 14-tile Skullbuster hand.</li></ol></section>
<section><h2 id="details-skullbuster">Skullbuster · six skulls and cabinet game</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-skullbuster-clean" data-guide-step>Take cleaner (Disco pole table, subway lockers or Heebie stage) and cloth (Disco roof pallets, Rat King throne or Mule ladder scaffold), then clean the upstairs Disco cabinet. On its roof collect/place enough tiles for a fourteen-tile Mahjong hand: four triples (identical or consecutive) and one pair, with no more than four identical tiles. Carry one at a time; swap an unusable extra for another.</li>
<li id="guide-step-skullbuster-numbers" data-guide-step>Use the source’s candle-marked glass panes to draw 1 on the Disco street window, 9 opposite Racin’ Stripes roof, 7 in Trail Blazers’ hall and 2 beside the Dojo. A wrong pane or timeout retries that number next round. At the start of a round, jump the white-circle path from RPR without overshooting; touch the final skull. A fall waits for the next round.</li>
<li id="guide-step-skullbuster-train-phone" data-guide-step>Jump into the skull on the passing Bang Bangs train. This deliberately downs you: prepare a teammate revival or solo Up ’N Atoms first. At an interactable subway phone dial 555-0152 and stay through the completion sound; damage interrupts it.</li>
<li id="guide-step-skullbuster-game" data-guide-step>All players enter Skullbuster. Entangle coloured cubes and colour question-mark cells to form three-skull lines or L shapes. Preserve the possible groups for other colours; three wrong placements fail and require another 555-0152 call. Finish three rounds for permanent perks (solo Up ’N Atoms excluded) and packed Wheel weapons for this match.</li></ol></section>
<section><h2 id="details-music-and-pam">Music, Savage calling card and Pam</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-music-and-pam-music" data-guide-step>Interact with seven active hidden radios for Cats on the Boulevard. Check the Dojo robot-table trash and Heebie entrance pallet, back-room crate, roof tire/wood/chute areas, Park electrical/trash locations, R-VN table, Disco roof/desk trash and sewer pipe. The radio about David Savage also begins a separate calling-card route.</li>
<li id="guide-step-music-and-pam-savage" data-guide-step>After the Savage recording, stare at the rooftop Savage Industries clock cipher. Interact with all twelve subway standing trashcans (five Main Street, seven Spawn), then reveal ciphers at the Mule dumpster, street stop sign, inaccessible Trail Blazers staircase ceiling and Spawn bank-side gate. The Tuff ’Nuff wall cipher is source-reported as an online server-time window of midnight–1 a.m. Eastern; changing the local clock is not a reliable method. Finally aim at the Rat King chair for the reward.</li>
<li id="guide-step-music-and-pam-pam-code" data-guide-step>After earning this map’s Soul Key, select Shaolin in the lobby and enter Up, Up, Right, Left, Down, Left. Confirm Pam’s icon before starting.</li></ol></section><section><h2 id="guide-sources">Sources and review</h2><p>Source-reviewed on 8 October 2026, using the references below and the research handoff. These instructions and puzzle calculations have software checks; they have not been verified in a complete in-game playthrough. Record symbols, sequences and completion cues from your match. Screenshot and community-chart creators are credited with each illustration.</p><ul><li><a href="https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/IW/shaolin_shuffle/shaolin_shuffle_guide" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Illustrated quest and equipment reference · mmmrkennedy ↗</a></li>
